Report: AURA — Creative AI Design & Development Studio
AURA is a premium landing page template designed for creative AI studios, 
combining modern aesthetics with clean and efficient web technologies. Developed using HTML5, Vanilla CSS, and ES6+ JavaScript,
it provides a fast, lightweight, and highly responsive user experience without relying on external frameworks. 
The template includes both automatic and manual dark/light theme support, allowing users to switch themes while saving their preferences using local Storage.
Its responsive Grid and Flexbox layouts ensure seamless performance across mobile, tablet, and desktop devices. AURA also features glass morphism effects using advanced CSS properties such as backdrop-filter, creating a sleek and professional interface.
The interactive contact form improves usability with floating labels, real-time validation, and loading animations.
Smooth reveal-on-scroll effects are implemented through the Intersection Observer API, enhancing user engagement while maintaining excellent performance. Additionally, an active section tracker automatically highlights navigation links as users scroll through different sections, improving navigation. 
By using inline SVG icons and loaders, AURA reduces external HTTP requests, resulting in faster loading times. Overall, AURA is a modern, visually appealing, and performance-focused landing page template suitable for creative agencies, AI startups, and SaaS businesses.

